  <!-- EN: ate doshian jelly -->
  <AteDoshianJelly.stages.ate_doshian_jelly.label>吃了道士果冻</AteDoshianJelly.stages.ate_doshian_jelly.label>
  <!-- EN: I can't tell if it's overly tangy or just stinging my mouth. Quite the sensation. -->
