  <AteMeiloorun.stages.ate_meiloorun.description>鲜嫩多汁、沁人心脾，meiloorun 是如此美妙的享受。</AteMeiloorun.stages.ate_meiloorun.description>
  <!-- EN: ate mudhorn egg -->
  <AteMudhornEgg.stages.ate_mudhorn_egg.label>吃了泥角蛋</AteMudhornEgg.stages.ate_mudhorn_egg.label>
